+Defendable: an AI technical interviewer. A recruiter generates an assessment
+from a job offer; the candidate builds a Deno HTTP API with any AI tool; an AI
+interviewer then talks with the candidate by voice about their own code; the
+recruiter reads a report that separates verified facts from AI interpretations,
